Dataset
-------
LeFood-Set v1, DOI 10.17632/cchsk79jkt.1, was created by Yuita Arum Sari,
Yudi Arimba Wani, and Atsushi Nakazawa and is provided under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

PlateGauge filters dataset rows, pairs and hashes images, computes derived
labels and evaluation splits, preprocesses images, and trains derived model
weights. Those are PlateGauge changes; the dataset authors do not endorse this
project. The full dataset archive and source collection are not distributed.
The benchmark explorer includes 20 byte-identical source JPEGs, renamed to the
stable `<source-id>-<before|after>.jpg` convention and disclosed as five
selected successes plus five largest errors rather than a random sample. The
trained FP32 ONNX artifact is also treated conservatively as dataset-derived.
Those examples and the model retain this attribution, the source DOI, the
license link, and this change notice.

