Software dependencies
---------------------
PlateGauge depends on separately licensed open-source packages, including
PyTorch, timm, ONNX, ONNX Runtime, NumPy, Pillow, openpyxl, React, and
TypeScript ecosystem packages. Their own licenses apply. The static release
bundle includes the current generated production JavaScript dependency/license
inventory at `legal/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.json`; the repository also preserves
the locked Python inventory and time-stamped vulnerability-scan evidence.
